      "message": "Fyi... In my scenario, it was called at init second stage from this function: load_properties_from_file(\"/vendor/build.prop\", nullptr, \u0026properties)\n\nAdditionally, after this log was printed,for instance:\ninit: Do not have permissions to set \u0027ro.com.google.gmsversion\u0027\nto \u0027N_preview\u0027: SELinux permission check failed\n\nThere were no further related denial logs printed, so it\u0027s hard to debug that such violation.",
