      "writtenOn": "2026-02-24T10:29:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Dear Mr.Inseob,\n\nFYI...\n- Since these denials occur during boot, then setting rate by auditctl is not applied when rebooting.\n- When loading property files from /vendor* or /odm*, the process operates under the restricted vendor_init context as line #729 rather than the full init context. This is where the SELinux denials specifically occur.",
